irst newline are
              omitted so the heading stays one line. Anchor and help icons
              remain visible.

        Examples
        --------
        >>> import streamlit as st
        >>>
        >>> st.title("This is a title")
        >>> st.title("_Streamlit_ is :blue[cool] :sunglasses:")
        >>> st.title("Dashboard", icon=":material/dashboard:")

        .. output::
        